# Historical reports refer to local-only evidence and user-specific sessions.
# They remain on the local machine; the reviewed public reports are below.
/docs/*
!/docs/BENCHMARKS.md
!/docs/LICENSING.md
!/docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
!/docs/RELEASE-NOTES.md
!/docs/benchmark-summary.json
!/docs/QUICKSTART.txt
!/docs/assets/
